  "@type": "Capability",
  "critical": false,
  "description": "Manufacture of wire rope from high-carbon steel wire: wire drawing, stranding (laying wires around a core), and rope closing (closing strands around a core). Covers rope constructions (6×7, 6×19, 6×37), tensile strength grades (1570-1960 MPa), end fittings (swaging, socketing), inspection and discard criteria, and lubrication. Essential for mining hoists, cranes, elevators, bridges, and cable stayed structures.",
